で、試合中疲れてても楽しそうにしてると思います）\n\n服は資料にある運動着姿でも先生のお好きに描いて頂いても大丈夫です！\n\n頂いたイラストは個人のSNSにて掲載、アイコン/ヘッダーとして使用、又キャラの参考資料として依頼時に提出、個人利用の範囲でアクリルプレートなどグッズ化させて頂きたく思っています\n\n何か問題があればお気軽にキャンセル、再送要請お願いします！\nご検討いただけますと幸いです！何卒よろしくお願いします", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kshima_mo369/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/50e8c019/uploads/origins/0eed3ba3-3b32-4b46-bb4c-1b3916b86867?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59d5b2548b49c272ea5bf17abe064883", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/50e8c019/uploads/origins/0eed3ba3-3b32-4b46-bb4c-1b3916b86867?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59d5b2548b49c272ea5bf17abe064883, https://si.imgix.net/50e8c019/uploads/origins/0eed3ba3-3b32-4b46-bb4c-1b3916b86867?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6820b36316509d96299a31c280e9864c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/50e8c019/uploads/origins/0eed3ba3-3b32-4b46-bb4c-1b3916b86867?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d83ec959133a57a53ab65185b9c5857e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "しまもさん、はじめまして。\nしまもさんの素敵な絵柄に惹かれました、もしよければ、FFXIVのマイキャラのイラストをお願いしたいです。\n\n参考資料：https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/17ejCbP9S58MIo1zP5-6kUntkpm1pFlgD\n\n彼女はストレートの黒髪で、目の色は紫と青のオッドアイです。耳の代わりに角があり、両方の角に金属の飾りがあります。彼女の顔、首、手、腰と足の部分が鱗があります。後ろに尻尾も付いています。後ろに尻尾も付いています。とても大人しくて、ややシャイな女の子です。\n\n参考資料にはいくつの衣装があって、お好きな衣装で描いてください。構図や背景などはしまもさんにお任せします。ご自由にアレンジしても大丈夫です！\n\nもし二次創作はNGの場合はオリキャラのイラストをお願いします！\n参考資料：https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/11jthUFgZUOFLP-ahD6L4E5I58evIzJdh\n彼女はワンサイドアップの黒髪で、目の色は紫と青のオッドアイです。\n*髪型は普通のストレートロングではなく、髪の一部を片方だけ結んでいる髪型になります。\n\nご多忙とは思いますが、ご検討頂ければ幸いです。\nどうぞよろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kshima_mo369/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7583a7a3/uploads/origins/601af2b0-d668-4ac1-ba6d-ce089032b33c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ad9c6893abc4ee6b0706a7684fe82060", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7583a7a3/uploads/origins/601af2b0-d668-4ac1-ba6d-ce089032b33c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ad9c6893abc4ee6b0706a7684fe82060, https://si.imgix.net/7583a7a3/uploads/origins/601af2b0-d668-4ac1-ba6d-ce089032b33c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d523c1b248e602397b5a426f8a1c3615 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7583a7a3/uploads/origins/601af2b0-d668-4ac1-ba6d-ce089032b33c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=638d4c8eff74b9aacd2210de16f22906 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, writer.\nPlease take care of this girl.\nPlease make it look like a proud lady.\nPlease dress in plain clothes.\nI'll leave the design to you.\nI'll leave the background, composition, and pose.\n\n■ It's an image material\n- - - https://imgur.com/a/yliayJQ\n\n■ Purpose of use is as follows.\n- It's Vtuber fan art\n- It's Twitter\n- This is the schedule\n- It's a YouTube thumbnail\n- It's for broadcasts\n\nIf there is a problem with the request, I would appreciate it if you could request it again.\nIf you don't get it, you can cancel it.\nPlease take good care of me.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kshima_mo369/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e6f4a689/uploads/origins/3f1b1705-bdbc-4f99-82b0-2fce35f92c14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c34e397af3cc61a22f0cb5467719a332", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e6f4a689/uploads/origins/3f1b1705-bdbc-4f99-82b0-2fce35f92c14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c34e397af3cc61a22f0cb5467719a332, https://si.imgix.net/e6f4a689/uploads/origins/3f1b1705-bdbc-4f99-82b0-2fce35f92c14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=20761432f9a72fd6dab51a56385a7615 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e6f4a689/uploads/origins/3f1b1705-bdbc-4f99-82b0-2fce35f92c14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f62fdd66e57ae55809dbba57a7fc50e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!! I really like the way you draw expressions and your choice of colours!\nI would like to request art of my OC\n\nHis name is Edward and he is a doctor who works in disaster relief. He is a cheerful happy person who likes being around people. He likes spending time with friends, whether that's playing sports or eating out! He is also kind and gentle, especially with his patients, but is also headstrong and stubborn, and will fight his way for what he believes is right.\n\nThematically he is associated with the stars and the flower zinnia. Despite how cheerful and happy he is, he yearns for connection and is a person full of nostalgia. He thinks fondly of his friends, even if they aren't around anymore.\n\nHis hair has gone through many styles, but his current style is this: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1m3iBHUpJLx6GnhoJTACDxHOwItzU7YUn/view\n\nPlease feel free to design a new set of clothing for him! He often wears clothing like these: https://www.pinterest.com/pin/374361787754565890/\nI will leave pose, composition and clothing to you!\n\nMore references in the google drive below\nI hope you have fun with this commission!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1qsFi-dJuHbd7qHq9iYNR4n85kTvds3PJ?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kshima_mo369/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b51ea769/uploads/origins/533e2884-2b2c-4f07-845e-00ca68a0b20a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=745ce4b0746c13a46bfbe97fb71a500e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b51ea769/uploads/origins/533e2884-2b2c-4f07-845e-00ca68a0b20a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=745ce4b0746c13a46bfbe97fb71a500e, https://si.imgix.net/b51ea769/uploads/origins/533e2884-2b2c-4f07-845e-00ca68a