. I may use this for SNS websites and I will credit your name! \n\nThese are references I drew: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1oZLXg9cMjtrx5YhEDk2LukIlDI3eHjEQ?usp=share_link\n\nThank you very much for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1oZLXg9cMjtrx5YhEDk2LukIlDI3eHjEQ?usp=share_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kshima_mo369/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e03e22e7/uploads/origins/28623ee5-e4c2-4c6a-b586-037891d788ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fc64c4a56069bd8725d037f47db3edc6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e03e22e7/uploads/origins/28623ee5-e4c2-4c6a-b586-037891d788ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fc64c4a56069bd8725d037f47db3edc6, https://si.imgix.net/e03e22e7/uploads/origins/28623ee5-e4c2-4c6a-b586-037891d788ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f46d87d962413e3b9e786642b2deed7c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e03e22e7/uploads/origins/28623ee5-e4c2-4c6a-b586-037891d788ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f11c93bb00add7317145ef1891a7289e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I'm Raimu, nice to meet you. I've been waiting for a long time for the reopening of the call for applications because your beautiful illustrations caught my attention...!\n\nI would like you to draw a character that I use in the game PSO2.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1OFZ6r3I5l_ieNQTqIN_62I71ZVGj8_wv?usp=sharing\n\nPose, composition, etc. are all up to you! (I would appreciate it if you could draw the whole purple color...)\n\nThank you very much for your cooperation.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kshima_mo369/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/56d7376b/uploads/origins/703cdfc0-8339-4249-923d-29c357e4a37f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9fa118